     "email": "kwildfeuer@me.com",
     "date": "2026-08-16T23:56:40Z"
    },
    "message": "Remove IP-strategy material from the public docs\n\nPatent drafting context, filing posture and counsel notes were sitting in\npages/docs/SPEC.md and a vault decision page \u2014 several of them labelled\n'private, not for public spec' while being served publicly. They are\ninternal notes and do not belong in this repository at any time.\n\nTRADEMARK.md keeps the reservation the licenses depend on (CONSTITUTION\nArticle XXXV cites it) and drops the rest: the enumerated wordmark table,\nthe usage matrix and the registration-status detail were an invitation to\nargue about names rather than a protection. Same reduction applied to the\nplaces that mirrored the list. Relaxing, never tightening - Article XXXV\nis satisfied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
